Output docs/demo/.build/demo.mp4

Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 20
Set Columns 100
Set Rows 26
Set Padding 0
Set Margin 32
Set MarginFill docs/demo/background.jpg
Set BorderRadius 14
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 40
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set CursorBlink false
Set Framerate 30
Set TypingSpeed 10ms

Hide
Type `source docs/demo/setup.zsh`
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+O
Sleep 1200ms
Type@120ms "buld"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
